  "thag1.104:0.4": "Thag 1:104 Khitaka ",
  "thag1.104:1.1": "How light my body! ",
  "thag1.104:1.2": "Touched by abundant rapture & bliss, ",
  "thag1.104:1.3": "—like a cotton tuft borne on the breeze— it seems to be floating —my body! ",
